lt, who comes from an elf village, embarks on an adventurous journey for her seriously ill sister. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But she will encounter various dangerous monsters on the way. Can she escape from this forest safely? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will her blood dye this forest red... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Feature\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore death\u30fbgrotesque erotic visual novel game <br>Various death scenarios: Death from blood loss, predation, petrified destruction, explosion, amputated, penetration by tentacles </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959640/extras/9778f478f5e799aacbd78c8464207f54.avif?t=1753163686\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Sharp thorns embedded in the ground penetrated the body, and died while unable to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959640/extras/87a9e912287daaccea4510f3bc5c5d99.avif?t=1753163686\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Caught by two monsters, the monsters invaded the body. Died because her abdomen and chest were eaten alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959640/extras/f15b16bf51a187a49b0b54e87785127e.avif?t=1753163686\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014After being petrified, the head, torso, and feet were destroyed in turn,<br>she turned into dust and died. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959640/extras/990f9299cac9910e7696081693edb427.avif?t=1753163686\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014She was caught from behind by a large monster. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually both arms were torn off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich plot of more than 50,000 words. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine has full Japanese dubbing. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 exquisite event CG pictures and 7 memory events. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Character\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959640/extras/2392840b72e23975a11f98b5245cec01.avif?t=1753163686\" width=600 height=300 /></span>Colt (CV: \u79cb\u5c71\u306f\u308b\u308b)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful and smart elf girl with excellent archery skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She embarked on a journey to heal her sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959640/extras/02fd1b2cb236eb9c53af19db41547b36.avif?t=1753163686\" width=600 height=300 /></span>Philum (CV: \u3086\u3065\u304d\u3072\u306a\u3002)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colt's sister, a girl who was born frail and sickly.</p>",
